					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Boccocarro</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>God</name>
									<type>Creator of All</type>
									<gender>Male</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Individualist</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Liberal Way</name>
						<adjective>Post-Baptist</adjective>
						<memberName>Post-Baptist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>God's Guide</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>God's Guide</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The people of the cavernous shell-world Boccocarro, both Post-Baptists and others, lived in peace for many years under the watchful eye of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt;. A mine hypervisor arose and threatened to destroy &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt; himself using an archotech mass-inverter. A community cook named Vladislav Houston was blessed by &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt; and gained miraculous knowledge of the unique power of each and every Post-Baptist. He said to each one what they needed to become their best self. The Post-Baptists gathered in a secret conference with many of the abyssal marines. They all learned to see the value in each other and abandon the mine hypervisor.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The people of the cavernous shell-world Boccocarro, both %%memberNamePlural%% and others, lived in peace for many years under the watchful eye of %%deity0_name%%. A mine hypervisor arose and threatened to destroy %%deity0_name%% %%deity0_objective%%self using an archotech mass-inverter. A community cook named Vladislav Houston was blessed by %%deity0_name%% and gained miraculous knowledge of the unique power of each and every %%memberName%%. He said to each one what they needed to become their best self. The %%memberNamePlural%% gathered in a secret conference with many of the abyssal marines. They all learned to see the value in each other and abandon the mine hypervisor.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>RoundA</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightOlive</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.445, 0.395, 0.886, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_OriginChristian</li>
							<li>Individualist</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Post-Baptist Funeral</name>
								<def>Funeral</def>
								<ID>3</ID>
								<randomSeed>-1421826758</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<nameMaker>NamerRitualFuneral</nameMaker>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<ritualExpectedDesc>Once a {IDEO} member dies, other {MEMBERS} gather around their grave for {RITUAL_labelDef}.</ritualExpectedDesc>
								<ritualExpectedPostfix>{0} {1} want to carry out the funeral as soon as possible.</ritualExpectedPostfix>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
								<generatedAttachedReward>True</generatedAttachedReward>
								<sourcePattern>FuneralStandard</sourcePattern>
								<obligationTargetFilter Class="RitualObligationTargetWorker_GraveWithTarget">
									<def>GraveWithTargetsCorpse</def>
									<parent>Precept_3</parent>
								</obligationTargetFilter>
								<targetFilter IsNull="True" />
								<behavior Class="RitualBehaviorWorker_Funeral">
									<def>Funeral</def>
								</behavior>
								<triggers>
									<li Class="RitualObligationTrigger_MemberDied">
										<mustBePlayerIdeo>True</mustBePlayerIdeo>
									</li>
								</triggers>
								<outcomeEffect Class="RitualOutcomeEffectWorker_FromQuality">
									<def>AttendedFuneral</def>
									<compDatas>
										<li IsNull="True" />
										<li Class="RitualOutcomeComp_DataThingPresence">
											<presentForTicks>
												<keys />
												<values />
											</presentForTicks>
										</li>
									</compDatas>
								</outcomeEffect>
								<activeObligations IsNull="True" />
								<lastFinishedTick>-1</lastFinishedTick>
							</li>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Post-Baptist Funeral</name>
								<def>FuneralNoCorpse</def>
								<ID>4</ID>
								<randomSeed>1933812351</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
