						<name>Verminous Way</name>
						<adjective>victoryist</adjective>
						<memberName>Victorist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Prime High Speaker</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Prime High Speaker</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>There is no higher lifeform than the Hive Queens. Their nourishing jelly is like ambrosia, and the entire world should be remade in their image. They are the pinnacle of evolution. Ravenous. Destructive. Indestructible. Everyone should strive to become like them. We will revere their ways, their collective intelligence and we will learn from them, becoming like a tidal wave that will wash over our enemies.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>There is no higher lifeform than the Hive Queens. Their nourishing jelly is like ambrosia, and the entire world should be remade in their image. They are the pinnacle of evolution. Ravenous. Destructive. Indestructible. Everyone should strive to become like them. We will revere their ways, their collective intelligence and we will learn from them, becoming like a tidal wave that will wash over our enemies.</descriptionTemplate>
