						<description>Hidden to the prying eyes of scientists and philosophers, an occult world of hidden knowledge awaits. Only a select few have the mental strength to acquire such insights. Such occult knowledge will require an open mind. We'll need to welcome all sorts of creeds and beliefs into our fold.</description>
