						<name>Cult of Ño'croitro</name>
						<adjective>Ño'croitroic</adjective>
						<memberName>Ño'croitroist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Great Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Great Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ño'croitro&lt;/color&gt; spoke to his followers: "Act with the heart of the warrior." As &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ño'croitro&lt;/color&gt; commanded, we always took care of one another and pooled our resources so no one has to suffer alone. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ño'croitro&lt;/color&gt; said to all the Ño'croitroists, "For you shall follow my Chosen One, the God Emperor, and prostrate yourselves in humility, submission and adoration."</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% spoke to %%deity0_possessive%% followers: "Act with the heart of the warrior." As %%deity0_name%% commanded, we always took care of one another and pooled our resources so no one has to suffer alone. %%Deity0_name%% said to all the %%memberNamePlural%%, "For you shall follow my Chosen One, the God Emperor, and prostrate yourselves in humility, submission and adoration."</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
