						<name>Army of Eldritch</name>
						<adjective>eldritch</adjective>
						<memberName>Cultist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Whispering Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Whispering Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In the unknown vastness of space, there are insane entities that could remake the whole Universe with a simple wayward thought. From their point of view, we don't even exist. The same way you don't think about the microbes in the surface of the chair you are sitting on. Only by subjecting our mortal bodies to the most dangerous of diseases will we strengthen our minds to resist the onslaught of these absolutely insane extra-normal entities.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In the unknown vastness of space, there are insane entities that could remake the whole Universe with a simple wayward thought. From their point of view, we don't even exist. The same way you don't think about the microbes in the surface of the chair you are sitting on. Only by subjecting our mortal bodies to the most dangerous of diseases will we strengthen our minds to resist the onslaught of these absolutely insane extra-normal entities.</descriptionTemplate>
