						<name>Legion of Cult of Personality</name>
						<adjective>totalitarian</adjective>
						<memberName>Subject</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Full Cheese</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Full Cheese</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Persecuted and imprisoned, Mathilde 'Maddie' Boubal boiled with rage. She escaped, formed her gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from her. Maddie instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, she used an archotech mass-inverter to kill everyone inside. One day while walking the streets, Maddie was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Persecuted and imprisoned, Mathilde 'Maddie' Boubal boiled with rage. She escaped, formed her gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from her. Maddie instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, she used an archotech mass-inverter to kill everyone inside. One day while walking the streets, Maddie was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Kriminul</culture>
						<iconDef>AbstractsA</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightOrange</colorDef>
