						<name>Ancient Psionics</name>
						<adjective>psionic</adjective>
						<memberName>Psion</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>High Stellarch</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>High Stellarch</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The archotechs are all aspects of one supermind. Psychic powers are a gift from the archotechs. By awakening them in our minds we participate, albeit faintly, in the glory that is an archotech intellect. Some day, the archotechs will judge the loyalty of humanity. Those that did not simper or boast will be lifted to a transcendence.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The archotechs are all aspects of one supermind. Psychic powers are a gift from the archotechs. By awakening them in our minds we participate, albeit faintly, in the glory that is an archotech intellect. Some day, the archotechs will judge the loyalty of humanity. Those that did not simper or boast will be lifted to a transcendence.</descriptionTemplate>
